                                     _________     /                                               \  min (1 , N - 1)
                          (N mod 2)  |       |    /                       ωc²                       \^
               /   ωc   \^           |       |   /  -----------------------------------------------  \
    B (s)  =  ( -------- )           |       |  (                  /   2N - 1 - 2ν \                  )
               \ s + ωc /            |       |   \   s²  +  2 sin ( π ------------- ) ωc s  +  ωc²   /
                                       ν = 0      \                \       2N      /                /


  Where  N ∈ ℕ  is the order of the filter,  ωc ∈ ]0 , +∞[  is the cutoff frequency, s = jω and ω ∈ ]0 , +∞[ is any frequency.

